                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Had a meaningful discussion with Allied Health Services about the challenges in long-term healthcare and the steps we\u2019re taking to support our nurses and elderly, two groups that are absolutely vital to the well-being of Northeastern Pennsylvania. Grateful for the work they do every day to care for our community.",
