                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "From helping veterans receive the benefits they earned, to resolving Social Security and Medicare issues, to cutting through red tape with the IRS and passport services, our office is delivering real results. Our team shows up every day with one goal in mind: helping the people of Northeast Pennsylvania.",
