                "text": "I spoke with Bill O\u2019Boyle about why I voted to secure the border, cut taxes, invest in American workers, protect Medicaid, and strengthen our national defense. This legislation puts the needs of our country and PA-08 families first. Read the full article here \u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/91u6YsNfOi",
