                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Visited the Geisinger Commonwealth School of Medicine\u2019s Medical Sciences Building, grateful to see future physicians preparing to serve our communities. Proud to support institutions advancing healthcare, research, and medical education. https://t.co/pnauYQpII2",
