                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today\u2019s vote was an easy call. Our government needed to reopen, because working people shouldn\u2019t have to pay the price when Washington can\u2019t get its act together. I\u2019m ready to roll up my sleeves and work with anyone to make healthcare easier to afford, lower the cost of living, and deliver real results for the folks who keep Northeastern Pennsylvania running.",
